WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 32]

01:43.140 --> 01:43.820
Tree Fairy.

01:44.460 --> 01:45.660
You always thought

01:46.380 --> 01:48.180
that he and I were really in love.

01:48.420 --> 01:49.479
But what about now?

01:51.539 --> 01:53.140
Is this the ending of

01:53.860 --> 01:54.770
true love?

01:55.539 --> 01:57.100
What is the difference

01:57.620 --> 02:00.150
between his actions and those of the animals?

02:02.500 --> 02:05.690
Is it really because immortals are different from demons?

02:05.690 --> 02:06.420
It turned out

02:08.009 --> 02:09.539
those what the Masters said

02:10.300 --> 02:11.540
were correct.

02:14.220 --> 02:15.060
I knew

02:15.780 --> 02:17.140
that you simply looked down on demons

02:17.140 --> 02:18.460
in your heart.

02:19.900 --> 02:21.180
I'm a demon, so what?

02:21.940 --> 02:23.220
In the Three Realms,

02:23.900 --> 02:26.030
except your brother and God of the Sun,

02:26.140 --> 02:27.940
everyone surrenders to me.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.870
Those so called Masters...

02:31.100 --> 02:33.660
Saying that immortals are different from demons...

02:33.660 --> 02:35.380
When I attack Immortal Palace

02:35.860 --> 02:38.100
and they all kneel in front of me,

02:39.140 --> 02:40.020
you will know

02:40.570 --> 02:41.410
that

02:42.380 --> 02:44.510
I'm much more honorable than they are.

02:47.140 --> 02:47.930
Demon King.

02:49.810 --> 02:52.660
Whether you pretended to be a lake demon to deceive me,

02:52.660 --> 02:55.390
or conquered the Three Realms to prove yourself,

02:56.620 --> 02:57.660
you were wrong.

02:59.420 --> 03:00.300
People like you

03:01.820 --> 03:05.020
don't know the difference between honorable and humble.

03:07.380 --> 03:08.460
Let me tell you,

03:09.780 --> 03:12.780
those who care about the common people are honorable,

03:13.060 --> 03:15.900
and those who kill innocent people are humble.

03:17.660 --> 03:18.540
I, Ze Shui,

03:20.020 --> 03:22.940
am ashamed to have married such a despicable person as you.

03:22.940 --> 03:24.060
Say it again!

03:24.060 --> 03:24.980
All right!

03:25.180 --> 03:26.020
I am ashamed

03:26.020 --> 03:27.780
to have married such a despicable person as you.

03:27.780 --> 03:28.579
May you

03:28.890 --> 03:30.060
never see me again

03:30.260 --> 03:31.460
forever.

03:38.579 --> 03:39.220
Ze Shui!

03:43.610 --> 03:44.180
Ze Shui!

03:45.780 --> 03:47.510
How dare you treat me like this?

03:47.940 --> 03:49.400
How could you do this to me?

03:50.500 --> 03:51.420
Do you know

03:52.500 --> 03:55.100
that I pretended to be a lake demon to deceive you,

03:55.100 --> 03:57.450
and conquered the Three Realms to prove myself

03:57.450 --> 04:00.380
just to prove that you did not marry the wrong person?

04:00.380 --> 04:01.500
Even if I am a demon,

04:02.620 --> 04:03.950
I am still your husband,

04:04.300 --> 04:05.650
and the best!

04:06.500 --> 04:07.770
Supreme Gods

04:08.220 --> 04:09.260
and Immortals

04:10.220 --> 04:11.620
are no match for me.

04:12.100 --> 04:14.300
None of them deserve to compare with me!

04:19.140 --> 04:19.980
So

04:20.500 --> 04:21.620
Immortal Ze Shui

04:22.019 --> 04:23.820
committed suicide afterwards?

04:24.300 --> 04:25.140
Yes.

04:25.940 --> 04:26.820
At that time,

04:26.980 --> 04:28.900
two Supreme Gods were in retreat.

04:29.620 --> 04:32.580
God of the Moonlight sensed her danger

04:32.580 --> 04:34.110
and immediately went over.

04:35.620 --> 04:36.820
But...

04:37.610 --> 04:39.020
he was still late.

04:40.220 --> 04:43.540
Therefore, the curse he set was extremely powerful.

04:44.380 --> 04:47.220
The people of Aquatic Demons have tried their best,

04:47.220 --> 04:48.750
but they couldn't break it.

04:55.620 --> 04:58.020
But none of this has anything to do with you.

04:58.060 --> 05:00.490
The reason I am telling you this today

05:00.740 --> 05:02.060
is to let you know

05:02.740 --> 05:04.180
that demons are evil.

05:05.580 --> 05:06.540
I know

05:06.700 --> 05:08.980
that Fu has helped you in the human world,

05:09.100 --> 05:10.940
but as the general of the Demons,

05:11.010 --> 05:12.340
he is cruel by nature.

05:15.060 --> 05:15.900
Luo Ning,

05:17.220 --> 05:19.500
I know you want to repay him,

05:19.700 --> 05:21.340
and it's rare that he's willing to listen to you.

05:21.340 --> 05:22.140
If one day

05:22.570 --> 05:24.570
he ever wants to do bad things again,

05:24.780 --> 05:26.260
you have to persuade him.

05:26.660 --> 05:28.220
For Fu,

05:28.860 --> 05:32.300
you are the only one who can lead him to kindness.

05:46.620 --> 05:47.740
Master,

05:47.740 --> 05:49.620
don't you have ten thousand years of immortal power?

05:49.620 --> 05:50.300
Can't you

05:50.780 --> 05:51.740
make this pill

05:51.900 --> 05:53.860
smaller?

05:54.420 --> 05:55.700
It's not my fault.

05:55.940 --> 05:57.700
There is one ingredient missing in it.

05:57.700 --> 05:59.260
The Star Stone sent by He Na

05:59.460 --> 06:00.940
was very difficult to melt.

06:00.940 --> 06:03.070
It's not easy that I can make this pill.

06:03.530 --> 06:05.210
He Na is such a nice guy.

06:05.500 --> 06:06.660
Star Stones are so rare,

06:06.660 --> 06:08.120
but he sent it generously.

06:10.740 --> 06:11.380
Yes.

06:12.300 --> 06:14.630
We'd better repay him as soon as possible.

06:17.060 --> 06:18.720
He didn't ask you to repay him.

06:21.220 --> 06:22.140
You're right.

06:22.740 --> 06:23.660
He Na

06:24.300 --> 06:25.420
is really nice.

06:25.860 --> 06:28.260
He's just troublesome occasionally.

06:29.500 --> 06:31.940
If he didn't give you the Six-star Brilliant Array,

06:31.940 --> 06:35.140
you wouldn't need Master to help you replenish your body.

07:01.580 --> 07:03.300
Wait, what are you doing here?

07:05.500 --> 07:07.420
I can't let Immortal know.

07:07.780 --> 07:08.980
He would

07:08.980 --> 07:10.140
have killed me

07:10.140 --> 07:11.020
if he knew

07:11.860 --> 07:13.520
I delivered medicine to He Na.

07:15.180 --> 07:17.180
He Na lost a hand because of me,

07:17.900 --> 07:19.900
and suffered such a serious injury.

07:19.940 --> 07:21.470
I feel very guilty about it.

07:23.700 --> 07:25.860
You want to hide it from Immortal Luo Ge,

07:25.860 --> 07:27.590
and you're acting like a thief.

07:29.780 --> 07:31.710
Which thief are you talking about?

07:32.500 --> 07:33.540
No, no, no.

07:33.540 --> 07:35.140
What?  Don't listen to his...

07:35.260 --> 07:36.700
Nonsense.

07:36.980 --> 07:38.580
I... Why... why are you here?

07:38.740 --> 07:40.380
Shouldn't... shouldn't you be

07:40.380 --> 07:42.020
recuperating at Palace Chongyang?

07:42.020 --> 07:43.380
Why are you here?

07:47.659 --> 07:49.420
But why do I feel

07:51.180 --> 07:53.240
that you are just acting like a thief?

07:54.780 --> 07:56.220
Am I?

08:00.420 --> 08:01.540
What's in the box?

08:04.460 --> 08:05.100
Show me.

08:19.140 --> 08:21.600
I thought a thief had come to Xiyin Mountain.

08:25.740 --> 08:27.500
It turned out that the thief was not from outside,

08:27.500 --> 08:28.700
but someone we know.

08:30.580 --> 08:31.820
What... what are you talking about?

08:31.820 --> 08:33.280
These are all my own stuff.

08:33.299 --> 08:35.179
Can't I give... give them away?

08:40.289 --> 08:40.690
I...

08:42.220 --> 08:43.900
I... I'm just an errand runner.

08:43.900 --> 08:44.690
I'm just a looker-on.

08:44.690 --> 08:45.950
She is the mastermind.

08:46.380 --> 08:46.780
You...

08:51.210 --> 08:52.870
Since you are willing to do it,

08:53.780 --> 08:55.040
help me get this to him.

09:00.380 --> 09:02.380
This is the spirit vein of Water Dragon.

09:02.380 --> 09:04.980
Although it's not as good as He Na's Demon King spirit vein,

09:04.980 --> 09:06.060
it's close enough.

09:06.970 --> 09:08.230
It's good for his hand.

09:09.180 --> 09:11.240
It turns out that you have noticed it.

09:11.780 --> 09:14.100
Have you been looking for it for a long time?

09:14.100 --> 09:15.400
He Na is also my friend.

09:17.890 --> 09:18.740
It turns out

09:19.220 --> 09:22.460
that you are also a person who cares about friends.

09:23.460 --> 09:25.820
I can't let you always pay people back

09:28.100 --> 09:30.700
because you feel sorry for them, right?

09:48.380 --> 09:48.940
Mr. Tai,

09:50.500 --> 09:52.660
how long has it been since Luo Ning left?

09:52.660 --> 09:54.260
I don't think it's been long.

09:57.900 --> 09:59.430
I made an agreement with her

10:00.220 --> 10:02.940
that no matter what happened to her after she went back,

10:02.940 --> 10:04.540
she would come back to see me.

10:06.500 --> 10:07.300
I think

10:07.300 --> 10:09.380
she must have forgotten me this time.

10:12.380 --> 10:14.020
Next time she comes back,

10:14.940 --> 10:16.400
I will definitely trap her

10:17.220 --> 10:18.880
so that she can never leave me.

10:20.580 --> 10:21.620
General Fu,

10:21.980 --> 10:23.980
you are just saying things in anger.

10:24.060 --> 10:25.320
It's useless to say so.

10:25.580 --> 10:28.290
If Fairy Luo Ning is really angry about your words,

10:28.290 --> 10:29.420
you definitely have to

10:29.420 --> 10:31.620
apologize to her.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.180
Shut up!

10:34.700 --> 10:35.380
General Fu.

10:35.380 --> 10:37.780
It seems that someone from Immortal Palace has come.

10:37.780 --> 10:38.340
Luo Ning!

10:43.460 --> 10:47.790
This is the spirit vein of Water Dragon that Immortal specially found for you.

10:49.820 --> 10:52.420
Please convey my gratitude to Immortal for me.

10:55.220 --> 10:56.620
Liu Shao is very careful.

10:56.900 --> 10:59.140
The medicinal herbs and supplements she sent

10:59.140 --> 11:00.540
are very suitable for me.

11:01.660 --> 11:04.190
It turned out that these were sent by Liu Shao.

11:04.380 --> 11:04.910
Brother.

11:05.820 --> 11:08.350
Can you stop treating that girl as a treasure?

11:08.660 --> 11:10.460
She doesn't even care about you.

11:10.900 --> 11:11.340
Look.

11:12.260 --> 11:14.090
She can make you so happy

11:14.460 --> 11:15.990
by just sending these crap.

11:16.340 --> 11:16.940
Fu.

11:17.380 --> 11:18.690
What are you talking about?

11:18.690 --> 11:20.180
These are collected by Liu Shao

11:20.180 --> 11:21.260
from Immortal Palace and the mortal world.

11:21.260 --> 11:22.420
She put a lot of effort into it.

11:22.420 --> 11:23.680
How could you say that?

11:24.300 --> 11:26.620
Are you unhappy

11:27.180 --> 11:28.780
that you failed to kill them?

11:30.860 --> 11:33.190
What are you talking about, you old demon?

11:33.660 --> 11:34.580
I didn't say it.

11:34.820 --> 11:36.220
It was… Master Shang.

11:39.420 --> 11:40.500
What did he say?

11:40.770 --> 11:42.020
He said

11:42.580 --> 11:44.640
that Moon Poison came from Xie Lingqi

11:44.900 --> 11:46.360
and later used by Bai Feng.

11:46.940 --> 11:49.100
The only one who could instruct them at the same time

11:49.100 --> 11:51.140
and had the motive to be enemies

11:53.260 --> 11:54.920
with Luo Ge and Liu Shao was Fu.

11:58.380 --> 11:59.640
What you are saying now

12:00.060 --> 12:00.990
is just baseless

12:01.100 --> 12:02.820
speculation.

12:03.700 --> 12:05.060
This is not my speculation.

12:05.060 --> 12:05.820
Anyway,

12:05.820 --> 12:06.820
Master Shang

12:06.820 --> 12:08.620
wouldn't think so for no reason.

12:10.060 --> 12:11.860
They must have heard something.

12:12.460 --> 12:13.500
That's the truth.

12:13.900 --> 12:14.500
By the way,

12:14.940 --> 12:16.200
Master Shang also said

12:16.660 --> 12:18.660
that you may not be innocent as well,

12:19.340 --> 12:21.740
because you were not afraid of Moon Poison.

12:21.980 --> 12:22.660
Maybe

12:23.700 --> 12:25.900
you were doing this to get close to Liu Shao

12:25.900 --> 12:27.030
and had other plans.

12:27.740 --> 12:29.020
It's fine if you just slander me,

12:29.020 --> 12:30.480
don't slander my brother!

12:31.410 --> 12:31.940
Fu.

12:32.420 --> 12:33.020
Let him go!

12:33.700 --> 12:34.500
Even if the immortal world and the demon world are at war,

12:34.500 --> 12:36.300
killing the envoy is forbidden.

12:50.260 --> 12:52.210
I just ran errands to deliver the medicine

12:52.210 --> 12:53.470
and almost got killed.

12:54.020 --> 12:55.220
Fu!

12:55.220 --> 12:56.680
How dare you pinch my neck?

12:57.500 --> 12:58.760
I'm going to learn that

12:58.820 --> 13:00.300
and strangle him too!

13:29.780 --> 13:30.420
Bai Feng?

13:40.820 --> 13:42.140
Fu is completely different

13:42.140 --> 13:43.180
from his brother.

13:43.420 --> 13:44.820
How could they two be brothers?

13:44.820 --> 13:45.770
I'll tell Liu Shao

13:45.770 --> 13:47.300
and let her be careful of Fu.

13:47.450 --> 13:48.020
Master.

13:49.260 --> 13:50.120
Fairy Luo Ning.

13:51.540 --> 13:52.180
Master.

13:52.700 --> 13:53.380
I just

13:53.460 --> 13:54.780
heard you mention Fu.

13:55.180 --> 13:56.380
What happened to him?

13:57.980 --> 13:58.910
I almost forgot.

13:59.420 --> 14:00.820
Did you know Fu very well

14:00.940 --> 14:02.600
when you were in mortal world?

14:04.140 --> 14:05.140
Yes.

14:05.140 --> 14:05.870
Listen to me.

14:06.260 --> 14:07.920
You should stay away from him.

14:10.060 --> 14:11.100
What's going on?

14:11.260 --> 14:12.180
Did he do something

14:12.180 --> 14:13.640
against Immortal Palace?

14:16.740 --> 14:18.420
Guess who I saw at the Moon Washing Pond

14:18.420 --> 14:20.700
when I returned from the demon world?

14:20.940 --> 14:21.540
Who?

14:25.620 --> 14:26.150
Brother.

14:26.620 --> 14:28.100
You don't really believe

14:28.420 --> 14:30.480
that grass demon's nonsense, do you?

14:33.890 --> 14:35.020
I probably know more

14:35.700 --> 14:37.220
than Wan Sui.

14:37.780 --> 14:38.530
Xie Lingqi

14:38.660 --> 14:39.740
just handed Moon Poison

14:39.740 --> 14:42.140
to the person under Four Seasons Monument.

14:42.180 --> 14:43.540
I'd like to know

14:44.940 --> 14:46.070
when you got in touch

14:46.460 --> 14:47.180
with

14:48.410 --> 14:49.380
that person.

14:53.450 --> 14:54.420
So what?

14:55.330 --> 14:57.190
As long as he could help my people,

14:57.340 --> 14:59.470
I could cooperate with him and use him.

14:59.530 --> 15:00.730
I don't care who he is.

15:00.820 --> 15:02.140
What about Bai Feng and Xie Lingqi?

15:02.140 --> 15:02.980
They have nothing to do with me.

15:02.980 --> 15:03.980
Stop lying!

15:05.380 --> 15:07.440
We may not be able to find Bai Feng yet,

15:07.460 --> 15:09.180
but Xie Lingqi has already repented.

15:09.180 --> 15:11.440
Do you want me to take you to confront him?

15:13.980 --> 15:15.020
Xie Lingqi...

15:15.820 --> 15:17.860
I did take advantage of him for a while.

15:17.860 --> 15:19.580
But he humiliated you before,

15:20.180 --> 15:22.180
so what's wrong with me using him

15:22.420 --> 15:24.350
to teach Immortal Palace a lesson?

15:27.060 --> 15:28.620
You used Xie Lingqi

15:28.740 --> 15:30.940
to assassinate Liu Shao and Zhuo Qiuxian.

15:30.940 --> 15:32.420
I tried my best to save you,

15:32.780 --> 15:35.140
and promised them that I would discipline you strictly.

15:35.140 --> 15:35.860
Now,

15:36.420 --> 15:37.700
you did this again.

15:38.100 --> 15:41.300
How do you want me to explain to Immortal Palace and Luo Ge?

15:42.300 --> 15:42.830
Brother.

15:44.340 --> 15:45.460
You are a demon.

15:47.340 --> 15:48.420
It is enough for you, Demon King,

15:48.420 --> 15:50.500
to maintain the peace of the demon world.

15:50.500 --> 15:51.820
You don't need to explain anything to anyone.

15:51.820 --> 15:52.890
If the Three Realms are in chaos,

15:52.890 --> 15:54.940
our demon world will also be affected.

15:54.940 --> 15:55.500
Guards!

15:56.160 --> 15:56.820
-Yes. -Yes.

15:59.620 --> 16:01.140
Fu was impulsive and reckless,

16:01.140 --> 16:02.460
and has violated orders.

16:02.460 --> 16:03.740
Whip him harshly

16:04.020 --> 16:05.280
as a warning to others.

16:40.060 --> 16:40.590
Luo Ning.

16:41.380 --> 16:43.380
My brother punished me again today.

16:43.460 --> 16:44.580
Among the Three Realms,

16:44.580 --> 16:45.910
only you are close to me.

16:46.740 --> 16:48.740
But you cruelly left me for so long.

16:50.540 --> 16:51.340
Fu,

16:52.260 --> 16:54.590
what are you plotting with Bai Feng again?

16:56.500 --> 16:59.100
If I'm the only one who can lead you to kindness,

17:00.340 --> 17:02.400
I can't let you go on making mistakes.

17:03.660 --> 17:04.300
Fu,

17:05.579 --> 17:06.940
I'll find out

17:07.660 --> 17:08.660
who you really are

17:09.700 --> 17:10.780
with my own eyes.

17:17.819 --> 17:19.050
Luo Ge.

17:20.339 --> 17:23.660
Guess what I have prepared for you.

17:25.660 --> 17:27.099
I can't wait.

17:28.339 --> 17:31.580
Luo Ge, don't bother.

17:32.620 --> 17:34.740
You can only walk on the path

17:34.740 --> 17:36.180
that I have drawn for you.

17:37.650 --> 17:41.700
Immortal Luo Ge isn't that powerful either.

17:44.020 --> 17:44.660
No.

17:45.260 --> 17:46.980
I can't let it be messed up like this.

17:46.980 --> 17:48.840
I must find it as soon as possible.

17:53.290 --> 17:54.860
Master has only left for a few hours.

17:54.860 --> 17:56.390
What brings you here again?

17:56.780 --> 17:58.380
I want to figure something out,

17:58.380 --> 17:59.860
so I need to be invisible.

18:00.500 --> 18:01.630
Among Demon Palace,

18:01.820 --> 18:03.260
your water energy

18:03.380 --> 18:05.220
is the best at covering up the aura.

18:05.220 --> 18:06.100
Along

18:06.260 --> 18:07.660
with the invisible perfume I made,

18:07.660 --> 18:09.740
I should be able to become invisible.

18:11.020 --> 18:12.380
Are you trying to investigate Fu?

18:12.380 --> 18:14.240
He didn't flirt with other girls.

18:15.980 --> 18:17.820
Would you lend it to me or not?

18:20.500 --> 18:21.300
Of course.

18:22.290 --> 18:23.330
General Fu,

18:23.330 --> 18:25.130
by the time you see your brother,

18:25.140 --> 18:26.800
Bai Feng has already arrived.

18:29.140 --> 18:30.060
Bai Feng?

18:31.420 --> 18:32.550
Has anyone noticed?

18:32.620 --> 18:34.140
There is a boundary around,

18:34.140 --> 18:35.380
no one will see her.

18:37.060 --> 18:37.540
Okay.

19:31.740 --> 19:32.380
Fu.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.590
I didn't ask you to come.

19:34.700 --> 19:35.630
Why are you here?

19:37.500 --> 19:38.380
Don't worry.

19:38.540 --> 19:40.070
I've set up a boundary here.

19:41.500 --> 19:43.700
The one from Immortal Palace asked me to find you,

19:43.700 --> 19:45.260
saying that with your help,

19:45.260 --> 19:48.100
we will be able to attack Immortal Palace and seize the sword.

19:48.100 --> 19:49.030
Seize the sword?

19:50.330 --> 19:50.860
No.

19:52.300 --> 19:54.660
Even with the power of Aquatic Demons,

19:54.900 --> 19:57.430
I'm afraid we can hardly be Luo Ge's opponent.

19:57.690 --> 20:00.220
It would be fine if Yin-yang Cave trapped him,

20:00.500 --> 20:02.090
but we lost our opportunity

20:02.090 --> 20:03.540
because of you.

20:05.380 --> 20:06.090
Fu

20:06.730 --> 20:07.860
did all this?

20:08.220 --> 20:08.780
What?

20:08.900 --> 20:10.740
Both my brother and your brother entered Yin-yang Cave?

20:10.740 --> 20:11.580
At least you can know their news

20:11.580 --> 20:12.740
as soon as possible

20:12.740 --> 20:13.780
if you stay here.

20:14.910 --> 20:16.810
-He was lying to me. -Let me know if you have any news.

20:16.810 --> 20:18.580
How about going to bed and resting for a while?

20:18.580 --> 20:20.140
Or do you want me to make perfume with you?

20:20.140 --> 20:22.220
How could you talk sweetly to me

20:22.860 --> 20:24.100
while plotting

20:24.300 --> 20:25.660
to kill my family?

20:26.140 --> 20:27.380
Although I failed,

20:27.820 --> 20:28.820
I told you

20:29.140 --> 20:30.540
that I wanted to be with Luo Ge.

20:30.540 --> 20:32.260
I never thought of taking Luo Ge's life.

20:32.260 --> 20:32.900
I know.

20:33.410 --> 20:34.470
But think about it.

20:35.140 --> 20:35.900
If Luo Ge

20:35.900 --> 20:38.300
is still an Immortal

20:38.980 --> 20:39.840
or Supreme God,

20:40.620 --> 20:42.620
will you have a chance to be with him?

20:42.780 --> 20:44.060
Whether he is a mortal

20:45.100 --> 20:46.100
or an immortal,

20:46.340 --> 20:47.780
I will definitely be with him.

20:47.780 --> 20:48.380
Great.

20:48.620 --> 20:49.570
But remember,

20:49.980 --> 20:51.500
if you want to be with him,

20:52.020 --> 20:54.350
you have to continue to cooperate with me.

20:54.500 --> 20:56.820
Luo Ge has been busy recovering recently,

20:56.820 --> 20:58.740
and this is our opportunity.

21:00.060 --> 21:00.590
Who is it?

21:04.780 --> 21:06.140
Didn't you say there is a boundary here?

21:06.140 --> 21:06.870
What is that?

21:07.740 --> 21:09.700
How did I feel my brother's aura?

21:11.060 --> 21:12.190
Demon King in White?

21:13.900 --> 21:16.300
My brother wouldn't do such a sneaky thing.

21:17.740 --> 21:18.570
Go back first.

21:18.900 --> 21:19.900
I will let you know

21:20.050 --> 21:21.090
if there is a plan for the next step.

21:21.090 --> 21:21.620
Yes.

21:40.980 --> 21:41.540
Luo Ning!

21:42.580 --> 21:43.110
Luo Ning!

21:44.980 --> 21:45.510
Luo Ning!

21:46.740 --> 21:47.620
Luo Ning!

21:57.580 --> 21:58.220
Who is it?

22:18.500 --> 22:20.540
You killed so many of our fellow disciples!

22:20.540 --> 22:22.450
Yes, it was him. Kill him!

22:37.660 --> 22:41.180
Even if his immortal energy is depleted, he is still an Immortal.

22:41.180 --> 22:42.460
I obviously asked you

22:42.460 --> 22:43.860
to send Liu Shao to Luo Ge.

22:44.420 --> 22:45.020
Remember,

22:45.660 --> 22:47.260
what you want is to get Luo Ge.

22:47.580 --> 22:48.930
And I am for my people.

22:49.860 --> 22:52.340
That person is just one of our pawns.

23:09.820 --> 23:10.350
Luo Ning.

23:10.900 --> 23:11.700
You're awake.

23:15.380 --> 23:15.780
Here.

23:18.580 --> 23:19.180
Thank you.

23:21.860 --> 23:22.860
What happened?

23:44.740 --> 23:45.270
Luo Ning,

23:46.900 --> 23:47.900
I'm really sorry.

23:49.620 --> 23:50.900
I didn't expect Fu

23:51.620 --> 23:53.420
to be so ambitious and reckless.

23:54.420 --> 23:55.950
You don't need to apologize

23:56.940 --> 23:58.260
for him.

23:59.620 --> 24:00.420
Now,

24:01.780 --> 24:03.310
even if he apologizes to me,

24:04.260 --> 24:05.460
I won't forgive him.

24:06.890 --> 24:07.550
From now on,

24:09.140 --> 24:10.940
I will treat him like a stranger.

24:12.100 --> 24:14.160
If he really dares to hurt my brother,

24:14.860 --> 24:16.780
I will definitely kill him.

24:17.420 --> 24:18.580
But you and Fu have already...

24:18.580 --> 24:19.540
So what?

24:20.900 --> 24:22.300
He touched my bottom line

24:23.020 --> 24:25.480
and there is no way I can forgive him anymore.

24:29.780 --> 24:31.710
Although he is excessively cruel,

24:32.220 --> 24:33.360
his feeling for you

24:34.140 --> 24:35.100
is real.

24:37.570 --> 24:39.100
Do you really feel that way?

24:40.180 --> 24:41.980
He keeps saying that he loves me,

24:43.260 --> 24:46.500
but he tries to destroy Immortal Palace and hurt my family.

24:46.500 --> 24:47.460
I don't need

24:48.740 --> 24:49.820
this kind of love.

24:51.500 --> 24:53.360
If he really force me to accept it,

24:54.500 --> 24:56.780
then I'll have to kill him.

24:58.700 --> 24:59.900
Either he dies

25:00.500 --> 25:01.660
or I die.

25:06.770 --> 25:08.220
I just want to ask

25:08.780 --> 25:09.780
if you will

25:10.060 --> 25:11.170
stop him.

25:12.260 --> 25:13.940
I'll go back and tell my brother right away

25:13.940 --> 25:15.740
if you won't.

25:17.380 --> 25:18.300
By then,

25:19.340 --> 25:20.060
I'm afraid

25:20.980 --> 25:22.910
it won't be up to you to deal with it.

25:34.420 --> 25:36.060
You don't have to worry about

25:36.420 --> 25:38.480
the things Fu and Bai Feng discussed.

25:39.220 --> 25:41.220
I will not let Fu have another chance

25:42.660 --> 25:44.260
to leave Demon Palace again.

25:50.820 --> 25:52.500
Got you. You are the traitor.

25:52.500 --> 25:53.340
What's going on here?

25:53.340 --> 25:53.980
Don't deny it!

25:53.980 --> 25:54.940
What's going on?

25:56.220 --> 25:57.580
Why is Xie Lingqi here?

25:58.380 --> 25:59.860
Who allowed you to bring him out?

25:59.860 --> 26:00.740
No, Immortal Master.

26:00.740 --> 26:02.940
Immortal asked us to catch the traitor.

26:03.260 --> 26:04.260
Coincidentally,

26:04.260 --> 26:05.740
we saw this person preparing to escape

26:05.740 --> 26:07.490
after destroying the Four Seasons Monument.

26:07.490 --> 26:08.750
He must be the traitor.

26:10.100 --> 26:11.020
I told you

26:11.020 --> 26:12.540
I was stopped by you

26:12.540 --> 26:14.340
while chasing the real traitor.

26:14.620 --> 26:15.620
Tell me in detail.

26:15.780 --> 26:16.530
What exactly

26:16.740 --> 26:17.460
did you just see?

26:17.460 --> 26:18.210
Well...

26:20.660 --> 26:22.260
Four Seasons Monument was damaged,

26:22.260 --> 26:23.250
and we only saw him running

26:23.250 --> 26:24.180
when we arrived.

26:24.380 --> 26:26.040
That must have been his doing.

26:29.900 --> 26:30.810
Xie Lingqi

26:30.810 --> 26:33.180
Xie Lingqi should have served his sentence under Four Seasons Monument

26:33.180 --> 26:34.620
and now he should be severely punished

26:34.620 --> 26:35.740
for escaping without permission.

26:35.740 --> 26:37.470
I will abolish his cultivation

26:37.580 --> 26:39.110
and interrogate him later.

26:43.180 --> 26:43.780
No.

26:51.980 --> 26:52.980
Immortal Master,

26:53.460 --> 26:54.900
there are still doubts about this matter,

26:54.900 --> 26:56.900
and we cannot make a conclusion now.

26:57.820 --> 26:59.300
Let's investigate first.

27:01.660 --> 27:03.170
Why is he still in Bone Melting Pool

27:03.170 --> 27:04.820
if he's innocent?

27:04.820 --> 27:06.680
You can not convince me with that.

27:08.780 --> 27:09.420
Ge,

27:09.820 --> 27:11.220
you are too softhearted.

27:11.570 --> 27:12.900
If we don't deal with him,

27:12.900 --> 27:14.020
what should we do

27:14.020 --> 27:16.020
if the evil thing becomes stronger?

27:18.020 --> 27:20.220
Take Xie Lingqi back to Bone Melting Pool first,

27:20.220 --> 27:21.620
and forbid him to get out.

27:24.500 --> 27:26.300
Do you have anything else to say?

27:30.050 --> 27:31.940
I'll do as you say.

27:49.940 --> 27:50.740
Madam,

27:51.340 --> 27:52.660
I finally know

27:52.970 --> 27:55.230
why Immortal Ze Shui would kill herself.

27:56.180 --> 27:59.980
It turns out that being extremely disappointed with the one you love

28:00.180 --> 28:01.660
is worse than death.

28:09.940 --> 28:10.740
What's wrong?

28:11.140 --> 28:12.540
Are you worried about me?

28:13.220 --> 28:14.140
Don't worry.

28:15.620 --> 28:17.300
I will not be like Ze Shui.

28:19.300 --> 28:20.760
I'm really disappointed,

28:22.660 --> 28:24.780
but I know what the right thing to do.

28:29.860 --> 28:30.460
Luo Ning!

28:32.050 --> 28:32.580
Luo Ning.

28:33.290 --> 28:34.550
When did you come back?

28:34.940 --> 28:36.200
Why didn't you tell me?

28:40.300 --> 28:41.100
What's wrong?

28:42.820 --> 28:43.980
You don't look well.

28:46.180 --> 28:46.910
Are you hurt?

28:47.540 --> 28:48.460
Who hurt you?

28:48.740 --> 28:49.300
Tell me.

28:49.580 --> 28:50.980
I'll cut him into pieces.

28:52.210 --> 28:53.050
Remember

28:54.380 --> 28:56.380
what you just said to me.

28:59.620 --> 29:00.700
Follow me.

29:07.380 --> 29:07.910
Luo Ning,

29:08.580 --> 29:10.180
what do you come to my brother for?

29:10.180 --> 29:11.040
What happened?

29:13.060 --> 29:13.740
Demon King,

29:14.590 --> 29:15.370
you said

29:15.660 --> 29:16.920
you would deal with it.

29:28.220 --> 29:28.820
Fu.

29:30.420 --> 29:31.060
Come here.

29:34.820 --> 29:35.680
Deal with what?

29:36.700 --> 29:38.630
Does it have anything to do with me?

29:38.780 --> 29:40.220
Or Luo Ning?

30:03.660 --> 30:04.540
Fu.

30:08.260 --> 30:10.020
Do you know what you are doing?

30:12.860 --> 30:13.260
Fairy.

30:15.540 --> 30:17.000
I've sealed his soul pill.

30:17.780 --> 30:19.380
so that he cannot use spells.

30:20.050 --> 30:22.380
And I will imprison him in the Demon Palace

30:22.700 --> 30:25.100
and forbid him to go out for a hundred years.

30:26.580 --> 30:27.900
Are you satisfied?

30:31.660 --> 30:32.500
I don't think

30:32.940 --> 30:33.800
a hundred years

30:34.380 --> 30:35.660
is long enough.

30:38.060 --> 30:39.660
Give him some pens and paper,

30:40.010 --> 30:41.610
and let him transcribe books

30:42.660 --> 30:43.920
to cultivate his mind.

30:44.740 --> 30:46.270
What are you talking about?

30:46.630 --> 30:47.900
What are you doing?

30:49.180 --> 30:51.580
Just let him transcribe Meditation Spell.

30:52.780 --> 30:54.110
Don't do anything evil,

30:54.980 --> 30:56.310
and do more good things.

30:57.620 --> 30:59.380
Give up evil thoughts

31:00.060 --> 31:02.120
and work hard to cultivate yourself.

31:02.980 --> 31:04.310
Don't do anything evil,

31:04.580 --> 31:06.020
and do more good things.

31:06.780 --> 31:08.570
Give up evil thoughts

31:09.180 --> 31:11.580
and work hard to cultivate yourself.

31:12.660 --> 31:13.190
Luo Ning,

31:14.540 --> 31:16.380
are you despising me

31:16.380 --> 31:17.340
because you blame me for doing too much evil?

31:17.340 --> 31:20.200
It turns out that you are aware of what you have done.

31:22.450 --> 31:22.980
Brother.

31:24.330 --> 31:25.540
Even if I did something wrong,

31:25.540 --> 31:27.940
it was because of a slight error in thought.

31:28.330 --> 31:29.590
Are you really going to

31:29.740 --> 31:31.540
imprison me for a hundred years?

31:32.980 --> 31:34.310
Among the Three Realms,

31:35.300 --> 31:36.560
I respect you the most,

31:38.780 --> 31:39.820
and Luo Ning

31:41.180 --> 31:42.580
is the one I love the most.

31:43.500 --> 31:45.820
You could punish me if I did something wrong.

31:45.820 --> 31:47.220
And I won't complain

31:47.220 --> 31:49.480
even if I am punished by you in a harsh way.

31:50.700 --> 31:51.960
I really didn't expect

31:52.180 --> 31:52.980
that in the end

31:53.700 --> 31:55.140
it would be you

31:55.140 --> 31:58.000
who joined hands to imprison me for a hundred years.

31:58.260 --> 31:59.320
Did I hear it wrong?

32:00.380 --> 32:01.640
After a hundred years,

32:02.620 --> 32:05.020
Luo Ge should be able to become Supreme God.

32:05.420 --> 32:05.880
By then,

32:07.140 --> 32:09.460
I don't have to worry about you working with Bai Feng

32:09.460 --> 32:10.790
to release that evil God

32:11.020 --> 32:12.680
and disrupt the Three Realms.

32:13.180 --> 32:14.380
I'll let you out then.

32:15.060 --> 32:15.990
So last night...

32:16.780 --> 32:17.310
Who is it?

32:17.380 --> 32:19.060
How did I feel my brother's aura?

32:19.060 --> 32:19.940
Demon King in White?

32:19.940 --> 32:22.330
My brother wouldn't do such a sneaky thing.

32:22.330 --> 32:23.340
When did you come back?

32:23.340 --> 32:24.600
Why didn't you tell me?

32:24.650 --> 32:25.540
You said

32:25.900 --> 32:28.830
that you would cut the person who hurt me into pieces.

32:32.860 --> 32:33.890
Didn't you ask me

32:35.140 --> 32:36.580
when I came back?

32:38.540 --> 32:39.980
I came back yesterday.

32:42.460 --> 32:43.460
I heard something

32:44.500 --> 32:45.820
before.

32:47.260 --> 32:48.460
I always thought

32:49.900 --> 32:51.900
that you were just scheming,

32:53.660 --> 32:55.860
but you wouldn't kill innocent people,

32:56.260 --> 32:57.980
nor would you hurt my family.

33:00.020 --> 33:00.860
So,

33:02.050 --> 33:04.710
I borrowed some water energy from your brother.

33:06.900 --> 33:08.330
I tried to use my own eyes

33:09.060 --> 33:09.740
and ears

33:11.260 --> 33:12.500
to

33:13.380 --> 33:14.450
figure out

33:15.820 --> 33:17.220
what kind of person

33:19.020 --> 33:20.300
I once loved is.

33:24.530 --> 33:25.460
Unfortunately,

33:27.620 --> 33:30.080
I heard too much that I shouldn't have heard.

33:30.580 --> 33:31.440
And I was almost

33:32.420 --> 33:33.820
killed by you.

33:34.700 --> 33:35.300
What?

33:37.460 --> 33:38.260
Did I hurt you?

33:38.700 --> 33:38.980
Luo Ning!

33:38.980 --> 33:40.440
I don't need your concern.

33:42.300 --> 33:43.760
Didn't you just promise me

33:44.690 --> 33:46.980
to cut the person who hurt me into pieces?

33:49.140 --> 33:49.930
Now,

33:53.580 --> 33:56.710
you are just going to be held captive for a hundred years.

34:05.620 --> 34:06.150
Luo Ning!

34:06.620 --> 34:07.150
Luo Ning!

34:09.860 --> 34:10.389
Luo Ning!

34:11.300 --> 34:12.020
Luo Ning!

34:13.340 --> 34:14.179
Luo Ning!

34:45.739 --> 34:46.400
Tree Fairy.

34:48.580 --> 34:50.980
Liu Shao said that you can sense emotions.

34:53.739 --> 34:54.699
Are you

34:56.020 --> 34:58.260
feeling sorry for me now?

35:08.300 --> 35:11.100
They all say you have ten thousand years of memory.

35:14.700 --> 35:16.020
Then tell me

35:18.220 --> 35:20.380
if Ze Shui back then

35:20.860 --> 35:22.420
was

35:24.660 --> 35:27.260
the same as me today?

35:58.480 --> 36:03.060
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

36:03.780 --> 36:08.350
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

36:09.100 --> 36:10.380
Since you're my husband,

36:09.460 --> 36:13.980
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

36:10.980 --> 36:11.980
you are mine

36:12.060 --> 36:13.180
from now on.

36:14.340 --> 36:15.460
Don’t you ever let me down.

36:14.700 --> 36:19.400
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

36:15.500 --> 36:16.540
I won't.

36:17.260 --> 36:18.460
If I break your heart,

36:19.060 --> 36:20.570
the Brahma tree will wither

36:20.570 --> 36:25.040
♫The stars call the morning sky♫

36:20.820 --> 36:22.350
and I will be alone forever.

36:25.710 --> 36:30.210
♫May you feel relieved♫

36:31.470 --> 36:35.980
♫I long for a hug♫

36:36.540 --> 36:41.790
♫Can I not just listen?♫

36:42.440 --> 36:45.890
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

36:46.490 --> 36:52.100
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

36:52.540 --> 36:57.410
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

36:57.700 --> 37:03.020
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

37:04.130 --> 37:07.790
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

37:08.300 --> 37:13.880
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

37:12.940 --> 37:13.820
It turns out

37:14.310 --> 37:19.650
♫When will we separate?♫

37:15.980 --> 37:17.940
Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui

37:18.340 --> 37:20.100
really loved each other so deeply.

37:19.840 --> 37:27.620
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

37:23.820 --> 37:24.660
Tree Fairy.

37:26.780 --> 37:28.020
Do you remember

37:28.620 --> 37:30.080
anything about the curse?

37:53.090 --> 37:57.630
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

37:53.340 --> 37:54.260
Ze Shui!

37:56.180 --> 37:56.980
Ze Shui!

37:57.940 --> 37:59.300
Why did you do this to me?

37:58.410 --> 38:02.590
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

38:00.900 --> 38:02.180
Why did you do this?

38:02.740 --> 38:04.700
How dare you hurt Ze Shui?

38:04.130 --> 38:08.490
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

38:07.020 --> 38:08.740
You and your people

38:09.230 --> 38:14.000
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

38:09.500 --> 38:11.580
will pay for this!

38:12.900 --> 38:14.140
I swear

38:14.860 --> 38:16.170
that your people

38:15.080 --> 38:19.300
♫The endless mountains and seas condensed into raindrops♫

38:16.170 --> 38:18.700
will be imprisoned in the deep water forever,

38:20.020 --> 38:24.980
♫I have walked thousands of miles with the feeling of missing you♫

38:20.060 --> 38:22.020
and that they will die

38:22.380 --> 38:23.860
when they leave the water.

38:25.980 --> 38:30.500
♫I want to ask the prophecy where I should go♫

38:28.300 --> 38:30.580
They will forever be despised

38:31.160 --> 38:37.030
♫For whom did the foreshadowing disappear?♫

38:32.740 --> 38:34.740
and will never be able to see the sun!

38:38.340 --> 38:41.820
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

38:40.020 --> 38:41.620
Except for me,

38:42.140 --> 38:44.900
this spell can only be lifted

38:42.370 --> 38:47.950
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

38:45.780 --> 38:48.370
when one of Ze Shui's descendants become Demon Queen.

38:48.370 --> 38:53.280
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

38:53.630 --> 38:59.320
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

38:59.940 --> 39:03.880
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

39:04.200 --> 39:10.100
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

39:10.250 --> 39:15.310
♫When will we separate?♫

39:15.630 --> 39:23.640
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

39:55.500 --> 39:56.700
What's going on with the Mother of Trees?

39:56.700 --> 39:57.500
She is so excited.

39:57.500 --> 39:57.980
Yes.

39:59.540 --> 39:59.970
Look.

39:59.970 --> 40:00.500
The Mother of Trees...

40:00.500 --> 40:01.980
What's wrong?

40:05.580 --> 40:07.440
It turns out that Immortal Ze Shui

40:07.820 --> 40:09.260
loved him

40:10.180 --> 40:11.040
like I loved Fu.

40:11.340 --> 40:12.600
But she suffered a lot,

40:13.540 --> 40:16.200
and even dragged her people to suffer together.

40:19.140 --> 40:19.670
Luo Ning,

40:21.380 --> 40:23.100
Fu did a lot of wrong things.

40:23.940 --> 40:24.940
I'm really sorry.

40:25.860 --> 40:27.190
I did not teach him well.

40:29.300 --> 40:30.180
I'm his brother.

40:30.180 --> 40:31.580
It's my responsibility.

40:35.300 --> 40:36.620
Have you ever thought

40:38.140 --> 40:39.800
that there might be other ways

40:41.130 --> 40:42.130
to break the curse

40:43.540 --> 40:45.870
besides breaking Four Seasons Monument?

40:48.660 --> 40:49.460
There should

40:50.460 --> 40:50.980
be.

41:05.220 --> 41:06.460
But we tried it before

41:07.540 --> 41:08.940
and it didn't work at all.

41:10.060 --> 41:10.540
Right?

41:15.980 --> 41:16.980
That's because

41:19.020 --> 41:21.480
I only inherited Ze Shui's immortal energy,

41:22.580 --> 41:24.180
but not her resentment.

41:25.780 --> 41:28.440
Even if I tried to think about how to forgive him,

41:30.180 --> 41:31.380
it wouldn’t work.

41:35.660 --> 41:36.610
But

41:38.140 --> 41:40.200
the memory of Brahma tree just show me

41:41.450 --> 41:43.820
that as long as one of Ze Shui's descendants

41:43.820 --> 41:45.220
